<%# A company's mark on a card. An emoji, a Tabler icon, one of the household's
   uploads, or a cropped image — whatever the square was set to. With nothing
   set it falls back to the company's initials over the colour it was given at
   creation, so a wall of applications is still scannable before anybody has
   picked anything. %>
<%
  mark = icon_ref_tag(job.logo)
%>
<span class="job-logo <%= size %><%= " has-mark" if mark %>"
      style="<%= "background: #{job.color};" unless mark %>">
  <%= mark || job.initials %>
</span>
